| riscos-n64 test run: Obey run-test <rom> <tag> <emumode 0|1|2> <VIs> [<gfx plugin>]
| ROM from roms/, results in out/: <tag>-log (hashes), <tag>-png (framebuffer at VI 120),
| <tag>-stdout, <tag>-stderr. Dummy video, audio and input unless a gfx plugin is given.
Dir <Obey$Dir>
Set N64_NOLIMIT 1
Set N64_QUITVI %3
Set N64_HASHLOG out/%1-log
Set N64_SHOT 120:out/%1-120.png
Set SDL_AUDIODRIVER dummy
WimpSlot -min 200000K -max 200000K
Run @.mupen64plus --noosd --configdir cfg --datadir data --gfx %4 --audio dummy --input dummy --rsp mupen64plus-rsp-hle --emumode %2 roms/%0 > out/%1.stdout 2> out/%1.stderr
